      "answer": "下面给出一个 **Python 3** 实现的闭区间合并函数 `merge_intervals`。  \n它只会合并 **相交** 或 **共享端点**（`end == start`）的区间，**不会** 把像 `[1,2]` 与 `[3,4]` 这样只相邻但不相交的区间合并。\n\n```python\nfrom __future__ import annotations\nfrom typing import List, Tuple\n\ndef merge_intervals(intervals: List[Tuple[int, int]]) -> List[Tuple[int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    合并闭区间列表，只合并「相交」或「共享端点」的区间。\n\n    参数\n    ----\n    intervals: List[Tuple[int, int]]\n        每个元组 (l, r) 表示闭区间 [l, r]，要求 l <= r。\n\n    返回\n    ----\n    List[Tuple[int, int]]\n        合并后的、按左端点升序排列的区间列表。\n\n    合并规则\n    -------\n    - 若区间 A = [a_l, a_r] 与区间 B = [b_l, b_r] 满足\n          b_l <= a_r   （即 b_l 在 a_r 左侧或恰好等于 a_r）\n      则二者应合并为 [min(a_l, b_l), max(a_r, b_r)]。\n    - 否则二者保持分离（即使 a_r + 1 == b_l 也不合并）。\n    \"\"\"\n    if not intervals:\n        return []\n\n    # 1️⃣ 先把区间按左端点排序（右端点若相同则保持原顺序）\n    sorted_intervals = sorted(intervals, key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1]))\n\n    merged: List[Tuple[int, int]] = []\n    cur_l, cur_r = sorted_intervals[0]\n\n    for nxt_l, nxt_r in sorted_intervals[1:]:\n        # 判断是否「相交」或「共享端点」\n        if nxt_l <= cur_r:                 # <= 包含了共享端点的情况\n            # 合并：右端点取更大的\n            cur_r = max(cur_r, nxt_r)\n        else:\n            # 不相交 → 把当前区间加入结果，开启新区间\n            merged.append((cur_l, cur_r))\n            cur_l, cur_r = nxt_l, nxt_r\n\n    # 最后一个区间\n    merged.append((cur_l, cur_r))\n    return merged\n```\n\n---\n\n## 边界测试（使用 `unittest`）\n\n```python\nimport unittest\n\nclass TestMergeIntervals(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_touching_endpoint(self):\n        # 共享端点应合并: [1,2] 与 [2,4] → [1,4]\n        intervals = [(1, 2), (2, 4)]\n        expected = [(1, 4)]\n        self.assertEqual(merge_intervals(intervals), expected)\n\n    def test_non_touching_adjacent(self):\n        # 只相邻但不共享端点不应合并: [1,2] 与 [3,4] → 保持分离\n        intervals = [(1, 2), (3, 4)]\n        expected = [(1, 2), (3, 4)]\n        self.assertEqual(merge_intervals(intervals), expected)\n\n    # 下面再补充几个典型的情况，帮助验证实现的完整性\n    def test_overlapping(self):\n        intervals = [(1, 5), (2, 3), (4, 8)]\n        expected = [(1, 8)]\n        self.assertEqual(merge_intervals(intervals), expected)\n\n    def test_unsorted_input(self):\n        intervals = [(5, 7), (1, 3), (3, 6)]\n        expected = [(1, 7)]\n        self.assertEqual(merge_intervals(intervals), expected)\n\n    def test_single_interval(self):\n        intervals = [(10, 20)]\n        expected = [(10, 20)]\n        self.assertEqual(merge_intervals(intervals), expected)\n\n    def test_empty_input(self):\n        self.assertEqual(merge_intervals([]), [])\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    unittest.main()\n```\n\n### 运行方式\n\n1. 将上面的函数和测试代码保存为 `merge_intervals.py`（或者任何你喜欢的文件名）。\n2. 在终端/命令行执行：\n\n```bash\npython -m unittest merge_intervals.py\n```\n\n如果实现正确，所有测试都会通过：\n\n```\n......\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 6 tests in 0.001s\n\nOK\n```\n\n这样就完成了 **闭区间合并函数** 的实现以及 **两个关键边界测试**（共享端点合并、相邻但不共享端点不合并）。祝你使用愉快！",
